# Rendered galleries. Three scripts produce every file under here, and at 600 dpi each render writes fresh
# multi-megabyte PNGs that do not delta against the old ones: tracking them took the repository to 220 MB across
# 41 commits. The figures the README shows live in man/figures/, which is tracked, web-sized and small.
figures/

